  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You wrap your body in swirling air, making you especially agile and hard to hit.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, your <strong>Defense</strong> and training in <strong>Dexterity</strong> increase by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>If a creature attacks you, you may immediately move 1 space in any direction after the attack is resolved.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the bonus to <strong>Defense</strong> or <strong>Dexterity</strong> by 1 per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.UIUqIRovbkdIUmQR]{Air Attunement}</p>",
